  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 1003.04 Purposes of Funding",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 1003.04 Purposes of Funding. Monies from the HWCF shall be used for the costs of disposal, supplies, contracted hazardous waste transportation, expenses associated with conducting the project’s educational component, or any combination thereof.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12352, eff 8-24-17; ss by #14284, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
